           <!-- Lyles Info -->
  <p style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 1em;" > <strong>Noah Lyles</strong> is one of the fastest sprinters in the world today. 
  He is a <strong>4x 200m World Champion</strong>, tying the legendary Usain Bolt. 
  His personal best in the 200m is <em>19.31 seconds</em>, making him the 
  third fastest of all time, behind Yohan Blake (19.26) and Usain Bolt (19.19). 
  Despite having asthma, Lyles continues to be dominate the track.</p>

    <!-- World Lead -->
       <img src="./19.51.jpg"width = 500 height = 300> 
<P style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 1em;">Above you see Noah Lyles finishing in the 2025 semi final with a <strong>WORLD LEAD</strong> 
running the fastest semi final time of all time of <em>19.51 seconds</em>
and despite critics stating he would not be able to perform as good in the final he still managed to run a 19.52
winning his 4th 200m world championship in a row</P>

